WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.205
Step 1. Open the questionnaire.

1.2
00:00:02.205 --> 00:00:06.367
Cloning creates a new draft questionnaire with the same questions.

1.3
00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:11.848
In Settings, under Forms, select Questionnaires, then select the questionnaire.

2.1
00:00:11.848 --> 00:00:17.206
Step 2. Start the clone. On the questionnaire page, select Clone Questionnaire.

2.2
00:00:17.206 --> 00:00:20.422
Care opens the Clone Questionnaire dialog.

3.1
00:00:20.422 --> 00:00:23.069
Step 3. Check the title and the slug.

3.2
00:00:23.069 --> 00:00:27.152
Care fills in both from the original, with the word copy added.

3.3
00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:31.735
The slug must not match another questionnaire in your facility.

4.1
00:00:31.735 --> 00:00:35.708
Step 4. Create the copy. Select Clone Questionnaire.

4.2
00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:38.859
Care opens the copy as a Draft at version 1.

4.3
00:00:38.859 --> 00:00:43.799
People can fill it in only after you set its status to Active.
